		{
			title: "More Personal Stones"
			icon: "waystones:warp_plate"
			x: 0.25d
			y: 5.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&bIf you are wanting to make a bit more of a enclosed Waystone system... one that isn't connected to the 'main' system, then you want to make a Sharestone network."
				""
				"&bSharestones cannot be teleported to with Scrolls or Warp Stones. You can only warp to a Sharestone via another Sharestone, and only if they both are the same color."
				""
				"&bIf you want an even more enclosed system, you'll want to use Warp Plates. When you place it down, it will automatically make an Attuned Shard that connects to that Warp Plate. "
				""
				"&bMake another Warp Plate, and place the Attuned Shard into it. Now that Warp Plate will teleport you to the first one. Or randomly to any Attuned Shard you put into it, as each Warp Plate has space for five Attuned Shards."
				""
				"&bYou can also make extra Attuned Shards in each Warp Plate."
			]
			dependencies: ["3C533A41BD14F645"]
			id: "056BDEB0979B74EF"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "33B2E6D6BFC53031"
