			subtitle: "What a Nice Box"
			description: [
				"&bNow finding ores is all well and good, those Bird Gems are quite annoying to find I hear. "
				""
				"&bBut what's more annoying is trying to find the right chests you need! The Vaults are full of them, of course, but not all what you are needing."
				""
				"&bThe Vault Chest Finder can be quite a useful tool to you in the Vaults, Bandit. They'll point colored lines towards the different chests, just gotta sort through what color is what."
