			description: [
				"&bChests, Ores, there's lots of em, they are easy to find or not, you'll trip over them at some point."
				""
				"&bCompleting the objective needs you to find one block in a giant room usually! Or one block in every giant room!"
				""
				"&bThe Vault Objective Finder will point towards your Monoliths, your Bounty Tables, your Alchemy Cauldrons, etc."
