		{
			title: "Tooling Upgrades"
			icon: "sophisticatedbackpacks:battery_upgrade"
			x: -3.25d
			y: 6.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "The Right Tool In The Right Place"
			description: [
				"&l&4RESEARCH : &r&4BACKPACK UPGRADES 1"
				"&l&4RESEARCH : &r&4MISC BAG UPGRADES"
				""
				"&bSome of the Upgrades you can add to your Backpacks are quite helpful with your tools."
				""
				"&bThe Battery Upgrade is great if you've unlocked some mods with energy dependant tools. While most of these will pale in comparison to the Vault Tools you can make, there's many Utility tools as well as Overworld tools that are great."
				""
				"&bThe Refill Upgrade is great if you are building or have a few blocks and food items in your hotbar you use constantly. It will refill items from the Backpack into the proper slot."
				""
				"&bAnd the Tool Swapper Upgrade can't be used in Vaults for... well, you want to use your Vault Tool anyways. But can be quite handy when exploring outside of Vaults, right? Just swaps your tool to the appropriate one for harvesting/breaking the block you are looking at."
			]
			dependencies: ["14C1EE7794D7D6FC"]
			id: "7363C04CA3959DB8"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "22589B7A564E807E"
					type: "item"
					item: "sophisticatedbackpacks:battery_upgrade"
				}
				{
