		{
			title: "The Limitless Upgrades"
			icon: "sophisticatedbackpacks:everlasting_upgrade"
			x: -4.25d
			y: 5.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Is There No End?"
			description: [
				"&l&4RESEARCH : &r&4MISC BAG UPGRADES"
				"&l&4RESEARCH : &r&4BAG INCEPTION"
				""
				"&bHey Bandit, I've talked with a few of the other researchers and the CEOs, and we've come up with some... special Backpack Upgrades for you!"
				""
				"&bNormally items that are left on the floor in the FOP Game Server are deleted after a few minutes."
				""
				"&bBut with the Everlasting Upgrade, your Backpack will be ignored if its fallen on the floor! Or if its fallen into the Void thats at the bottom of each dimension!"
				""
				"&bThe other one is the Inception Upgrade. Now, normally, you can't stack Backpacks inside of Backpacks. Things can get very silly, and even the FOP doesn't want the horrors that could create with their mess of a code."
				""
				"&bToo bad for them, with the Inception Upgrade, you now can!"
			]
